From: Primoz Ajdisek <bigpod@bigpod.si>
Subject: [PATCH] build: disable memory-intensive React Compiler optimization

The native React Compiler transform of the web UI consumes tens of GiB
and can starve hosted runners. Build the packaged UI with ordinary JSX
transformation; React Compiler is an optional memoization optimization.

--- a/apps/web/vite.config.ts
+++ b/apps/web/vite.config.ts
@@ -331,7 +331,7 @@
             ],
           }),
       tanstackRouter({ autoCodeSplitting: true }),
-      react({ compiler: true }),
+      react({ compiler: false }),
       tailwindPlugins(bundledDev),
       warmBundledDevPlugin(),
       bundledDev ? bundledDevStableNamesPlugin() : undefined,
